      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, chinakutopekaŋa nakutopekaŋa tuhu, saŋa waloŋela kweyi; hela chochu, nakeŋi kuhosha neyi muloŋa iwu, nami indi muntu watama wamwenaŋadi kuwaha munjila yindi? Indi antu ejima akwatilaŋa akwawu makasu atama ashakaminaŋadi chachiwahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunayitumbi dehi kweyi, eŋa, anashimati dehi ninyiji; awa akukula awa, eŋa, hiyakusoŋa ninyikabu; mukanwa kawu eyi wudi kwakwihi, munyichima yawu wudi kwakulehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyi Yehova waloŋalu kweyi; wanmonaŋa, wesekaŋa muchima wami chiwekala kudeyi; yitulumoni kulonda ayijahi, yijilikili ifuku dakuyijaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋa didishonaŋa tuhu, niyisakola yamwituŋa dejima yilepukaŋa tuhu kushika nikumwakanyi? Anyama ananoŋi, niatujila, nakutama kwawantu ashakamamu, muloŋa elili nawu, Hakamona kutwakakumishilaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuzeya nalufuchi lwakutemuka nawakwakwenda hamaseki, indi akwakwenda hatuwalu wakatwesha kweseka nawu ŋahi? Mwituŋa damwena diwakuhwelela wudi chachiwahi, indi mwitu daYodana wakela ŋahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hela ana kweyi, niakwamutaŋa watata yeyi, hela wena anakukwatili dehi makasu, hela wena anakubidiki dehi; bayi wuyitiyaku, hela akuhosha naneyi mazu amawahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitala dami nalekuku dehi, wuswana wami nawushiyi dehi. Wami nakeŋa mumuchima wami namuhani kudi ayilumbu jindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuswana wami wunambalumukili dehi neyi namutupa wamumpata, hakumbalokela chibwaji; dichi chinamuheli kwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi wuswana wami wambalumu-kila dehi neyi kajila kamaasamaasa kakwatanaŋa, tahindi? Atujila akwata-naŋa amunyeŋumuka dehi, tahindi? Yenu mwakapompeshi anyama amumpata ejima, yiletenu adyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atubiŋa amavulu anakisaŋani dehi itempa dami danyivinyu, anadatoli dehi iseka dami nanyendu yawu, iseka dami dadiwahi anadibalumuni dehi neyi isaŋa damukunkulwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anadibalumuni dehi kwamahembi hohu; daneŋaŋa kudami chidela dehi kwamahembi; ituŋa dejima dela dehi kwamahembi muloŋa hikudi muntu nachishi kumuchimaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakupupa anenzi dehi hayinaŋanaŋa yankumbu yamwisaŋa yejima; muloŋa mpoku yaYehova yakabali yidi nakudya ho-o, kufumisha kunsa yimu yetuŋa, ndo nikunsa vikwawu yetuŋa; kwosi muntu namoni kumwenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudima anadimi tidiku, anaaŋuli nyiŋa; anadikabakeshi tuhu, niniyi yanamonuwu nehi; nyikabu yenu mwakayitiya nsonyi, muloŋa wakuzuwa kwaYehova kwasweja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwetu twadikuma nawu atama ejima akunkaŋa kuwuswana wunaswanishi antu ami aIsarela, Yehova nayiteni chakuyizuwila nindi, Tiyenu, nakayibwita mwituŋa dawu, niakwamutaŋa waYuda nakayibwita mukachi kawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinakela nayibwiti dehi, nakafunta cheŋi nakuyitiyila wushona; nakayileta cheŋi, iwu kuwuswana windi, iwu kuwuswana windi, iwu kumpata yindi, iwu kumpata yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakadizawu chachiwahi mwelaŋawu antu ami mwakusanyika ijina dami, nakwila nawu, Chahandayi Yehova kwaamu, neyi china chalejeluwu antu ami kusanyika Bayali, henohu nakayitupisha mukachi kawantu ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa neyi kwonti kwawu kutiya, muza owu nakawubwita kubwita kwakukisaŋana. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
